     If we[0m[2m fix checkout[0m[2m to decrement[0m[2m first,[0m[2m then[0m[2m the[0m[2m overs[0m[2melling issue[0m[2m is mit[0m[2migated even[0m[2m without[0m[2m an[0m[2m inventory lock[0m[2m,[0m[2m BEC[0m[2mAUSE `[0m[2mdecrement[0m[2m` itself[0m[2m ([0m[2mthe[0m[2m check+[0m[2mdecrement[0m[2m part)[0m[2m is atomic[0m[2m in asyncio[0m[2m.[0m[2m
     
