     Actually,[0m[2m I'll[0m[2m add a[0m[2m lock to[0m[2m `Payment[0m[2mGateway`[0m[2m to be[0m[2m safe.[0m[2m But I[0m[2m don't[0m[2m want[0m[2m to serialize[0m[2m all payment[0m[2m processing[0m[2m unnecessarily[0m[2m. So[0m[2m I'll acquire[0m[2m the[0m[2m lock just[0m[2m around[0m[2m the mutation[0m[2m/check[0m[2m part[0m[2m:
     
